{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-title='ACL'>\r\n\t\t\tACL\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Copy a registry ACL from hkcu:\\software\\foo onto hkcu:\\software\\bar with get-acl and set-acl.","label":"Mirror ACL","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/acl","label":"ACL","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/acl"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/takeown","label":"takeown","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/takeown"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>$acl<\/code> must be changed to be applicable. Get the ACL from <code class='inline'>hkcu:\\software\\foo<\/code>, take its access rules as <code class='inline'>NTAccount<\/code>, remove and re-add the first rule, then apply the ACL to <code class='inline'>hkcu:\\software\\bar<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$acl = get-acl -path hkcu:\\software\\foo\n$r = $acl.GetAccessRules( $true, $true, [security.principal.ntaccount] )\n$acl.RemoveAccessRuleAll( $r[0] )\n$acl.AddAccessRule( $r[0] )\nset-acl -path hkcu:\\software\\bar -aclobject $acl<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/mirror_acl_registry\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/mirror_acl_registry\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/acl' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/acl' data-title='ACL' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>ACL<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/takeown' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl\/takeown' data-title='takeown' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>takeown<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-title='ACL'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>ACL<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}